    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi, Thank your for the great plugin! \r\n\r\nI am coming from https://github.com/numToStr/Comment.nvim which has such feature.\r\n\r\nIt would be really nice to have here too!\r\n\r\nconfig option can be `comment_next_line=\"gco\"`",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi, Thank your for the great plugin!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I am coming from <a href=\"https://github.com/numToStr/Comment.nvim\">https://github.com/numToStr/Comment.nvim</a> which has such feature.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It would be really nice to have here too!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">config option can be <code class=\"notranslate\">comment_next_line=\"gco\"</code></p>",
    "bodyText": "Hi, Thank your for the great plugin!\nI am coming from https://github.com/numToStr/Comment.nvim which has such feature.\nIt would be really nice to have here too!\nconfig option can be comment_next_line=\"gco\"",
